>I've burned through about 20 crystal ball charges (boy are they heavy) and
>haven't been able to get to the portal quickly enough.  How do find and
>get to it in time?

  Four or five cursed scrolls of gold detection let you zero in
on the portal quickly, if you're levitating.  Don't read the
first one until you're directly in the middle of the plain.

  Confused, non-cursed scroll of gold detection will make the
portal known to you so you'll see it, *if* it's in line of sight
*and* doesn't have an object or a monster on it.  Just like a
crystal ball does.  (Yes, a monster can be on the portal without 
disappearing on the Plane of Water.  Seems like a bug.)  

  Note that line of sight works differently when levitating on
the Plane of Water.  I don't think you can see "down" into an air
bubble unless you're within its confines, or perhaps on the edge.



